# Sanctuary Wall (0/4 defender): "{2}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature. You may put a stun counter on it. If you do, put a stun counter
# on this creature." (CR 701.26a, 122.1d, 608.2c). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Mox Pearl, Mox Jet) and on turn 3 activates it for {2}{W}
# (Black Lotus) at Bot2's untapped Ornithopter and accepts: the Ornithopter is tapped with a stun counter, and the Wall, tapped for
# the cost, has one too. A stun counter turns the next untap into removing it (CR 122.1d): on turn 4 Bot2's Ornithopter stays
# tapped and the counter is gone, on turn 5 Bot1's Wall stays tapped and loses its counter.

